//RS //! Checked request/result transport for the private generated compiler entry.
//RS //!
//RS //! The retained compiler MIR and the emitted binding descriptor are the sole
//RS //! shape authorities. Ordinary aggregates are copied only as required to cross
//RS //! the entry ABI. Shared, trait-object, and callable leaves go through the
//RS //! invocation-local NativeAdapter hook; they are never serialized as IDs or
//RS //! reconstructed from display text. Helper roots are recursively carried as
//RS //! checked MIR aggregates; only physical leaves use owner-issued carriers.
//RS 
