//RS /// Emit the typed argument/result codecs and one dispatch shim per checked
//RS /// `JetEvalHostAdapter` method. The native adapter's interface handler calls
//RS /// `__jet_bootstrap_entry_native_interface_{method}` with the live call and a
//RS /// typed operation; the shim decodes each checked argument (Move arguments are
//RS /// consumed through the call's transfer ledger), borrows the Source machine in
//RS /// place, runs the operation, and encodes its typed result. Methods returning
//RS /// the adapter trait object (sessions and clones) are answered by the adapter
//RS /// itself and get no shim.
